# Agent instruction adapters. CLAUDE.md is the tracked repository AUTHORITY;
# `.claude/skills/` is the authority for `.agents/skills/`. Both adapter trees
# and AGENTS.md are workstation-local and generated — never staged, never
# hand-edited (see CLAUDE.md "Authority", doctrine R7).
/.claude/
/.agents/
/AGENTS.md

# Local dev working folder — see dev-docs/README.md for the canonical layout.
# Durable: `plans/` (actionable plans/backlog), `designs/` (design-decision
# reference), `todos.md`. Auto-purged by the dev-docs-cleanup skill: `temp/`
# (>1d, offload large output here instead of printing it), `bin/` (>7d,
# soft-deleted docs). Local working state, never committed.
#
# KGLite re-includes `dev-docs/bench/scripts/` here because its benchmark
# harnesses are hand-authored source in exactly one copy. This project has no
# benchmark harnesses, so there is no exception to make: everything under
# dev-docs/ is local. If a hand-authored script ever lands here, re-include it
# the same way (`/dir/*` + `!/dir/sub/`) rather than leaving it unbacked.
/dev-docs/

# Inbox of feedback/coordination notes (`unread/` = needs action, `read/` =
# archive). Local working state, never committed — see CLAUDE.md
# "Inbox hygiene" and inbox/README.md.
/inbox/

# macOS / editor noise, and Python bytecode from scripts/
.DS_Store
__pycache__/
